 "stimulus_html": "<p>The graph below shows the total distance, in feet, walked by a person as a function of time, in seconds. Use this information to answer questions 6 - 7.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Distance Graph\" src=\"exercises/media/e6acae53e7fdd8f6.svg\"></p>\n <br>",
